{
  "body_human_readable": "### Oklahoma City Thunder Clinch 2024-2025 NBA Championship\n\nThe Oklahoma City Thunder have won the 2024-2025 NBA championship, defeating the Indiana Pacers in a thrilling seven-game series. The Thunder secured their first title since the franchise relocated from Seattle, winning the decisive Game 7 with a score of 103-91.\n\nThe championship series concluded on June 22, 2025, marking the first NBA Finals to go to a Game 7 since 2016.\n\n**Key Details of the Season and Finals:**\n\n*   **Finals MVP:** Thunder guard Shai Gilgeous-Alexander was named the NBA Finals Most Valuable Player.\n*   **Regular Season MVP:** Gilgeous-Alexander also earned the league's Most Valuable Player award for the regular season, making him the first player to win both awards in the same season since Stephen Curry in 2014-15.\n*   **Dominant Season:** The Thunder finished the regular season with a league-best 68-14 record, giving them home-court advantage in the Finals.\n*   **Franchise History:** This victory marks the franchise's second championship overall, with the first being in 1979 as the Seattle SuperSonics, and their first since moving to Oklahoma City in 2008.",
